            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioner argues that the government seeks to turn a violation of a car\u2011rental agreement into a rule that prevents unlisted drivers from invoking the Fourth Amendment."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
