            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 16,
              "start": 16
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioner contends that a person given permission by the renter to store personal items in the trunk has a reasonable expectation of privacy in it."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Loeb",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "85c0ffbd9353bfccaea1e7175abccac3eb42674538ff0228733f7180eeb43290",
