            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Loeb, petitioner asserts that criminal trespassers or car thieves do not have such privacy expectations."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "85c0ffbd9353bfccaea1e7175abccac3eb42674538ff0228733f7180eeb43290",
